    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d129">

                <pb facs="0244" n="134" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg134"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Treaty Series No. 807</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Japanese Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Matsudaira</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="japanese-nengō gregorian" when="1928-05-31"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">31st May, 3 Shōwa</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                                >1928</hi>)</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In proceeding today to the signature of the
                    Convention between Japan and the United States for the purpose of avoiding
                    difficulties which might arise in connection with the laws in force in the
                    United States on the subject of alcoholic beverages, I am happy to attach
                    hereto, for the purpose of future reference, a memorandum of the understanding
                    that has been reached between us in regard to the interpretation of the
                    Convention. I beg leave, therefore, to request that you kindly acknowledge and
                    confirm this statement.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed>T. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Matsudaira</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d129-a1.xml" xpointer="d129-a1"/>
            </div>
